  "body": "`Body.json()` should take an optional parameter to be passed to `JSON.parse(json[, reviver])` function to use a _reviver_ callback to parse JSON data.\n\nSee: [JSON.parse(): Using the `reviver` parameter](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/JSON/parse#Using_the_reviver_parameter) at the MDN.\n",
